late\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened on a room box</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U3</b> A box that starts with a room number (e.g. 'bed 415…') shows a room chip, and the picker suggests that room's patient. The physician still taps to assign; nothing auto-assigns.（UAT TC-04；TFA-92582 AC 4；TFA-92582 step 4；TFA-92583 AC 3）</li><li><b>U6</b> No auto-assignment anywhere: the app never splits one dictation across patients, never routes by name or room, and never merges boxes. There is no AI routing.（UAT TC-04；TFA-92582 AC 2；TFA-92583 AC 2）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>等价类（equivalence） — 同一条规则换一类输入（医院 / 养老院、另一种数据）再验一次，每一类都要对。</p><p><b>Given </b>QA Hosp Patel in room 415, QA Hosp Ortiz in room 416</p><p><b>When </b>Type into one box, replacing the text each time: 'bed 415 seen at 7, comfortable.' (then open Assign to patient on it and close the picker), 'Room 415: pain 3/10, on oral analgesia.', 'Rm. #415 — dressing changed.', '415 — afebrile, eating breakfast.', 'Looks better this morning, lungs clear.', 'QA Hosp Ortiz looks be …</p><p><b>Then </b>Each of the four room forms shows the chip and suggests Patel; the picker opened on the room box lists Patel (where he sits is recorded for Q1); the no-room text and the name-only text show no chip and no suggestion, and the name never routes the box to Ortiz; no text reaches either chart without a tap</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs: cp1 and cp3–cp5 mustContain 'Rm 415' and '415 · QA Hosp Patel', mustNotContain 'Re-assign' (U3). cp2 (picker open on the room box) mustContain 'Assign to patient', 'Search room or name', '415 · QA Hosp Patel', mustNotContain 'Re-assign'; Patel's place in the list and any mark are recorded for Q1. cp6 mustNotContain 'Rm 415' and 'Matches on your list'. …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U14；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（blocked）</p><p><small>S05 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-04.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-04 Quick Dictation (Hospital only; TC-05 Rounding Sheet merged in) · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-04/S05</p><p><b>Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened on a room box</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92582 Quick Dictation (ready for qa); TFA-92583 Rounding Sheet (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>generated/tc04s05/verdict.json</code>). Agent: 43 turns, 124 s, $0.23.</p><p><b>Recorded (evidence only):</b></p><ul><li>s05-picker-room.md: (Q1: where Patel sits in the picker opened on his room's box) pass: in order: &quot;415 · QA TC-04-S05 QA Hosp Patel LS0A&quot; &lt; &quot;416 · QA TC-04-S05 QA Hosp Ortiz LS0A&quot; (in from &quot;Search room or name&quot;)</li></ul><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U14 (#14, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Quick Dictation: room phrasing classes. Quick Dictation compartments belong to the account; quickDictation:list counts.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #14, U14; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — room chip + 'Matches on your list' suggestion for Bed/Room/Rm/bare numbers, none without a room, name match; nothing auto-assigns; assign appends verbatim</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-04 Quick Dictation (Hospital only; TC-05 Rounding Sheet merged in)","S05 Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"a76567f09c8d79d0313f00956ba6463b","originalF